{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30014_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:1a7dde54b91715e0f1a3d90d4a185a98349f3c05ca518850675614c247490412",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_d:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aedbda312e1e218dfa22954f862d98143e619e4c7476f3e7c15dc756502ae78c",
      "text": "抛开另外两个人不谈，本大爷可是最强的！\n现在就让你们见识见识本大爷的实力如何啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c86c65ba8d4bb22150b32e044d5066a0bb11b31db9129bea5b3177cac6872ade",
      "text": "冷静点，涟。这里是对台本的地方。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c7b7cb1a2f36d52e356ac2b14020e1649a5dc791882c49a621b80e4d863a01d",
      "text": "涟先生，我明白您的心情，\n但请冷静下来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_d:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:955f9c0aa4dd5fa9237cd20825db8d61ee4664d6d59bd50a014fe5894efe62e5",
      "text": "哈啊？先挑事的明明是那帮家伙吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bea7fd822118cd237091ca8b3faf3a36f43688813f460f0d638a7eea06207e4",
      "text": "……真、真是群野蛮的家伙。\n果然前格斗家就是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_d:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5199d9ee53e319f57e7dae3050632c995c3bf9ada5fec2d5ad92a45aae919f8b",
      "text": "快走吧。再跟他们说下去，\n连我们都会被当成一伙的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f003f767db3013f6b9a0f9219193e57161c0824d1e274280b0b42f38cd0d5dee",
      "text": "喂，站住……切！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_d:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:140eb451e61f385a0c0e52b6d540be6de59b9caa91a3bc39cf1a37f4f1e45c5d",
      "text": "……动手是不对的。\n圆城寺先生，谢谢你拦住他。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_d:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f502269a701aaff69ed27552fe9bb28bb684d2e7ce9915a26e6eb8fc453ea9f",
      "text": "……我心里也有怨气。\n但就算跟他们打嘴仗，他们也不可能心服口服。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_d:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fdc4cb406fccf0574ad6138efe60d2a8a916b4abe2a35bc704f2dc73dab6873",
      "text": "为了不再被他们用轻视的态度对待，\n唯有在正式演出的舞台上让他们见识见识了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30014_01:1_3_30014_01_d:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8246688b5046fe2a9922d7c7e7377aaf6a8fd23f8853ccd5d8b08320bf0191b9",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n请把练习课程的时间，安排得比现在更多一些。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
